    ('trades', 'Trades & home services', 'Call-out vans that tell customers who you are, what you fix and how to book.'),
    ('mobile', 'Mobile & personal services', 'Vehicles that are the shopfront, from groomers and mechanics to care teams.'),
    ('transport', 'Transport, fleets & highways', 'Consistent livery for fleets, removals, couriers and roadside crews.'),
